                docs: [
                    "[col-hashed-ordered] [implicit-recursive] A tuple compares and orders",
                    "**element by element, through the elements' own identities**: a",
                    "`(Person, Int)` compares by `Person`'s declared `eq`. Ordinary Salvo over the",
